      "description": "Watch Sevilla vs Barcelona highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on September 19, 2026. The clash between Sevilla and Barcelona lived up to its high-octane reputation, with both sides eager to claim dominance in this La Liga fixture. On September 19, 2026, the two teams engaged in a tactical battle that saw momentum swing dramatically throughout the ninety minutes. A Rapid Exchange of Blows Sevilla ignited the home crowd early when they broke the deadlock in the 19th minute. Following a key pass from Lucien Agoume , Felix Correia delivered a pin-point cross that allowed Youssouf Fofana to power a header into the back of the net. However, the celebrations were short-lived as Barcelona responded with clinical efficiency. Just three minutes later, Andreas Christensen turned provider for Raphinha , who calmly slotted home with his right foot to level the score and shift the pressure back onto the hosts. The Raphinha Masterclass The second half belonged entirely to Raphinha , who benefited from the creative genius of Lamine Yamal . In the 52nd minute, Yamal whipped in a delivery that Raphinha headed home to put the visitors ahead for the first time. The Brazilian winger completed a stunning hat-trick in the 69th minute; once again assisted by Lamine Yamal , he executed a delicate left-footed lob that left the Sevilla defense stranded and effectively decided the contest. Composure Under Pressure Barcelona maintained a commanding 69% of the ball possession, frustrating Sevilla 's attempts to mount a comeback. Late substitutions saw Dani Olmo , Karim Adeyemi , and Gabriel Jesus enter the fray to help see out the result. While Sevilla pushed forward in the closing stages with efforts from Isaac Romero , they struggled to break through a disciplined defensive line. A late yellow card for Lucien Agoume reflected the home side's frustration as the final whistle confirmed a comprehensive performance from the Catalan giants."
